@startuml contribution1_closed_loop_rl
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
left to right direction

rectangle "Minecraft world\n(blocks, entities, physics)" as WORLD

package "Forge mod (Java)" as FORGE {
  component "Observation build\n(ClientBridgeHooks /\nserver bot telemetry)" as OBS
  component "Action execution\n(key / look / interact /\nserver bot commands)" as ACT
}

package "Python bridge services\n(WebSocket server + JSON protocol)" as BRIDGE {
  component "Obs queue\n(schema validate)" as OQ
  component "Act queue\n+ sender loop" as AQ
}

component "Policy worker\n(DQN / RL step)" as POL

WORLD -down-> OBS : sample state\n(pose, rays, inventory, …)
OBS -right-> OQ : **observation**\n`kind: observation`

OQ -right-> POL : encode obs\n→ action index / cmd
POL -left-> AQ : structured **action**
AQ -left-> ACT : **action**\n`kind: action`
ACT -up-> WORLD : **effect**\n(movement, look, use, …)

note bottom of BRIDGE
  Single logical service: one process exposes
  the bridge (I/O, queues, validation, tick loops).
end note

note bottom of POL
  Closed loop each tick:
  world state → obs → policy → action → world
end note

@enduml
